      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHORTY (2) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (19.81) at Gunnedah over 340m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Top prospect. TOTAL TREASURE (7) was strongly fancied last time over 400m at this track but crowded for room and fell. Can do much better this time. YATHONG TIGER (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (18.66) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Great chance to atone. BELL MAC MAGIC (4) placed two runs ago then again in the money last time when second (23.22) at this track in a NG.",
